  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local service delivery enhance-UNDP-SYR-00131651</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR and UNDP collaborated on this project in two high-return areas Tadamoun and Darrya through the installation of electric transformers and the rehabilitation of the related Low and Medium-voltage Electricity Network which have been identified as critical by returnees and their communities, the governorate, and local authorities in order to strength the resilience, and secure the urgent access to the electricity needed for resuming social life in the mentioned areas.</narrative>
  </description>
